's ruling still holds: a justified unresolved answer counts as usable.\n 11589\t- **Next (D746).** The ruling's words go into the shared reader definitions (`blind_rules.py`). Then one $0 blinded re-read of nine\n 11590\t  stored answers, registered with its expected readings and reviewed by the council before any packet is read.\n 11591\t\n 11592\t## D748 · 2026-11-23 · The D747 re-read fails on a self-contradicting floor; three of four earlier splits settle under the ruling; council 63: ask Alex to authorize the E writer repair; the paid re-send stays on hold\n64:      \"reasoning_effort\": \"low\",\n65:      \"max_output_tokens\": 12000\n69:    \"model\": \"jev-1.14.0\",\n71:    \"reasoning_effort\": \"medium\",\n72:    \"max_output_tokens\": 12000,\n75:  \"rejudging\": {\n76:    \"model\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\n78:    \"reasoning_effort\": \"medium\",\n79:    \"max_output_tokens\": 16000\n82:    \"model\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\n84:    \"reasoning_effort\": \"medium\",\n85:    \"max_output_tokens\": 8000\n88:    \"model\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\n90:    \"reasoning_effort\": \"none\",\n91:    \"max_output_tokens\": 4000\n94:    \"model\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\n96:    \"reasoning_effort\": \"low\",\n97:    \"max_output_tokens\": 4000\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
